omaine des résidences seniors en France, réputé pour son expertise, la qualité de son accompagnement et son engagement envers le bien-être des seniors.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\n\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"11 Avenue René Cassagne","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQzNjBjNWExYWYzMTEyNzlhMjVmYmNkNTIwZTI2YmE0MWQ3NDI0ZDYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxMWU2MGE0N2E4NDE0ZGE2MTg2ZWY2ZWU1Yzc5YTgzNiJ9?signature=f370940bc51e3161001a13dd6079445e36b9a3aab34b25b05b64864c37e146cb","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjViNjFhYzY1ZDZhMDVlZDhhYzgwMzZlMWEzNTlkZTc1NTFjZDExNGYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxYTM2OGJiNTVkMDY3ZDNkM2I2OWIyMGEyYTYxNzMwYyJ9?signature=cee52b9e0bd01af5fb35c87def130f6bea23afca85706b1fcb7db9ff3e9d4b88","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjMzMGFhZmMwY2I1OWY5MmVmY2MyZmNmMTA5Nzk4NTQ3Yzc2NTMwOGUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkNjg3ZjI5NTc5Mjk0Zjg2NGU1ODU3YjlmNDZjYThiZCJ9?signature=535dfde924685dd7ec7d10249ae9032383167f80a702320c5bb4f85c551988c8","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImZmYjFhMmNjM2E3ZDNjOGQ1ODI0YWZiMTMzMDBhZDkwMTlkMzkzZjUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiNDljZmJlYWZjNzRlODJkYTdmMmY2OGU0MDRjMDUyZCJ9?signature=36da8c6cae19fd2a10c9be3ffca9d5b60328c140a912c46ca6a0d861754f9d2c","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjZkNDExNjhkNjFkZmFmZmNlMjI4MzY4MTA5MmNhZDY1MDJjOTY2MTgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNp